/></div></div><div class=\"for_welcome\"><div class=\"div-block-461\"><h1 class=\"heading-105\">Welcome to the FORTUNE theatre</h1></div></div><div class=\"for_what-s-on\"><h1 class=\"heading-104\">What&#x27;s On</h1><div class=\"div-block-460\"><div class=\"homepage-featured-show-div-block\"><div class=\"homepage-featured-show-div-block\"><div class=\"homepage-featured-show-image-mask\"><img alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/669e2ef2af6d63d18df72fef_OM_Title_1920x1080-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/669e2ef2af6d63d18df72fef_OM_Title_1920x1080-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/669e2ef2af6d63d18df72fef_OM_Title_1920x1080-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/669e2ef2af6d63d18df72fef_OM_Title_1920x1080-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/669e2ef2af6d63d18df72fef_OM_Title_1920x1080.jpg 1920w\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/669e2ef2af6d63d18df72fef_OM_Title_1920x1080.jpg\" class=\"homepage-featured-show-image\"/></div><a href=\"/operation-mincemeat-a-new-musical\" class=\"homepage-featured-show-button w-button\"><strong class=\"bold-text-36\">Find out more</strong></a><h3 class=\"homepage-featured-show-header\">Operation Mincemeat</h3><p class=\"homepage-featured-show-dates\">Wed 29 Mar 2023 - Sat 26 Sep 2026</p></div></div><div class=\"homepage-featured-show-div-block\"><div class=\"homepage-featured-show-image-mask\"><img alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6a0b078ac95376657d55bbed_NC_Live2026_1920x1080_ATG_title-treatment-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6a0b078ac95376657d55bbed_NC_Live2026_1920x1080_ATG_title-treatment-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6a0b078ac95376657d55bbed_NC_Live2026_1920x1080_ATG_title-treatment-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6a0b078ac95376657d55bbed_NC_Live2026_1920x1080_ATG_title-treatment-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6a0b078ac95376657d55bbed_NC_Live2026_1920x1080_ATG_title-treatment.jpg 1920w\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6a0b078ac95376657d55bbed_NC_Live2026_1920x1080_ATG_title-treatment.jpg\" class=\"homepage-featured-show-image\"/></div><a href=\"/natalie-cassidy-live-with-nat\" class=\"homepage-featured-show-button w-button\"><strong class=\"bold-text-36\">Find out more</strong></a><h3 class=\"homepage-featured-show-header\">Natalie Cassidy: LIVE with Nat</h3><p class=\"homepage-featured-show-dates\">Sun 8 Nov 2026</p></div></div></div><div class=\"for_info\"><div class=\"div-block-462\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6814edc9fbb5a9e66959a667_WhatsApp%20Image%202024-09-24%20at%2012.56.58%20(3).jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6814edc9fbb5a9e66959a667_WhatsApp%20Image%202024-09-24%20at%2012.56.58%20(3)-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6814edc9fbb5a9e66959a667_WhatsApp%20Image%202024-09-24%20at%2012.56.58%20(3)-p-800.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6814edc9fbb5a9e66959a667_WhatsApp%20Image%202024-09-24%20at%2012.56.58%20(3)-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/6814edc9fbb5a9e66959a667_WhatsApp%20Image%202024-09-24%20at%2012.56.58%20(3).jpeg 1600w\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"div-block-463\"><div class=\"text-block-61\">One of Covent Garden’s smallest theatres, the <strong>Fortune Theatre</strong> is a tight, atmospheric theatre. Built in 1924, the <strong>Fortune </strong>has seen many a major name up in lights, including <strong>Dame Judi Dench</strong> and <strong>Alan Bennett</strong>. From 1989 to 2023, the <strong>Fortune Theatre</strong> played host to the enigmatic and brilliant production of <strong>The Woman in Black, </strong>and is now showing the critically acclaimed musical<strong> Operation Mincemeat.</strong></div><a href=\"/about\" class=\"atg-button-homepage-copy w-button\">Find out more</a></div></div><div class=\"for_map\"><div class=\"div-block-464\"><div class=\"div-block-465\"><h3 class=\"heading-106\">FORTUNE theatre</h3><p class=\"paragraph-40\">Russell Street<br/>London<br/>WC2B 5HH</p><a href=\"/plan-your-visit\" class=\"atg-button-homepage-copy-copy w-button\">Plan your visit</a></div><div class=\"div-block-467\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5d8244207ea2939203abe159/661c1933d7aa742286bf6d1b_fortune_theatre_square.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Fortune Theatre map square\" width=\"350\" class=\"image-62\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"section-2\"><a href=\"https://www.atgtickets.com/coronavirus-info/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"vanya-main-button w-button\">Coronavirus: Information about suspended and rescheduled shows &gt; &gt;</a></div><div class=\"woman-slider\"><div class=\"woman-slider-holder\"><div data-delay=\"4000\" data-animation=\"cross\" class=\"slider w-slider\" data-autoplay=\"true\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-hide-arrows=\"true\" data-disable-swipe=\"false\" data-autoplay-limit=\"0\" data-nav-spacing=\"3\" data-duration=\"2000\" data-infinite=\"true\"><div class=\"title-bottom\"><a href=\"/woman-in-black\" class=\"booking-button-2 w-button\">Find Out More</a><div class=\"div-block-7\"><h1 class=\"heading-37\">Woman In Black</h1></div><div class=\"div-block-90\"><h2 class=\"genre-2\">Play</h2><h2 class=\"running-time-2\">Running Time: 2hr (inc. interval)</h2><h2 class=\"theatre-2\">Fortune Theatre</h2></div></div><div class=\"w-slider-mask\"><div class=\"sl